[agent:result] 
[agent:result]     If time travel is not enabled, it raises an exception.
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]     If `from_commit_time` is `None`, the commit window starts from the first commit.
[agent:result]     If `to_commit_time` is `None`, the commit window ends at the last commit.
[agent:result] 
